WEBVTT

00:00.230 --> 00:10.490
Tsuki no kaasu tsumetai yume no naka de

00:00.230 --> 00:10.490
Under the moon’s curse, inside of a cold dream…

00:18.870 --> 00:25.250
Kotoba no nai sekai de bokura wa ai wo kataru

00:18.870 --> 00:25.250
In a world without words, we speak of love

00:25.250 --> 00:29.460
itsuka kimi ni todoku made

00:25.250 --> 00:29.460
until it reaches you someday.

00:32.050 --> 00:38.930
Kizu darake no kaina de dakiyoseta kuchibiru no

00:32.050 --> 00:38.930
I want to melt the frozen over wish...

00:38.930 --> 00:44.770
haritsumeta negai tokashitakute

00:38.930 --> 00:44.770
from the lips that I embraced with arms covered in wounds.

00:44.850 --> 00:51.570
Nee, aishiatta kako no utsukushisa sutesareba

00:44.850 --> 00:51.570
Hey, if I abandon the beauty of the past when we loved each other,

00:51.940 --> 00:57.740
ashita motto kirei na yoru e yukeru kara

00:51.940 --> 00:57.740
then tomorrow, I can go to a more beautiful night.

00:58.120 --> 01:06.330
Tsuki no kaasu tsumetai yume no naka kara

00:58.120 --> 01:06.330
Under the moon’s curse, from inside of a cold dream.

01:06.330 --> 01:12.510
Kimi wo tooku tsuresaritakute

01:06.330 --> 01:12.510
I want to take you somewhere far away,

01:13.050 --> 01:16.380
doko made yukeru

01:13.050 --> 01:16.380
and go anywhere,

01:16.380 --> 01:24.600
ai wo shinjite ii basho made

01:16.380 --> 01:24.600
to a place where we can believe in love.

01:31.070 --> 01:32.260
Seimei...

01:33.170 --> 01:35.740
I don't know what is what.

01:36.450 --> 01:37.910
Soubi Agatsuma...

01:38.750 --> 01:42.700
He smelled like cigarettes.

01:44.210 --> 01:45.450
I love you.

01:46.670 --> 01:47.540
"Love"...

01:48.760 --> 01:50.440
That's what Soubi said...

01:52.180 --> 01:53.450
"I love you."

01:53.850 --> 01:55.100
Why?

02:01.180 --> 02:02.810
What's wrong?

02:04.480 --> 02:05.550
Nothing.

02:09.320 --> 02:10.150
Okay.

02:12.150 --> 02:20.210
Hey, if I remember the me before two years
ago, will the current me disappear?

02:22.880 --> 02:24.450
Well, I don't know.

02:25.210 --> 02:26.990
Are you okay with that?

02:27.500 --> 02:28.720
Sure...

02:28.720 --> 02:32.250
My life is boring.

02:38.260 --> 02:41.380
I'm not the one Mom is waiting for.

02:47.110 --> 02:48.850
Say, Ritsuka...

02:49.170 --> 02:52.810
Any human being can live for himself.

02:53.700 --> 02:55.780
You are fine the way you are.

03:00.990 --> 03:05.160
I don't think it's a
bad thing to be yourself.

03:06.960 --> 03:08.120
But...

03:11.460 --> 03:15.360
...the way I am now isn't the Ritsuka my mother knew.

03:16.840 --> 03:21.340
This is a sin that
deserves punishment.

03:26.410 --> 03:27.430
Huh?

03:27.950 --> 03:29.680
What happened to your hand?

03:30.940 --> 03:31.940
Nothing.

03:38.600 --> 03:40.260
Hey, Ritsuka...

03:42.830 --> 03:43.870
I'm sorry.

03:44.450 --> 03:47.370
I don't know what's going on,
but be careful from now on.

03:49.920 --> 03:51.250
You were like a different person...

03:51.250 --> 03:52.290
Don't say that!

03:52.460 --> 03:53.970
Don't ever say that again!

03:58.640 --> 03:59.630
Whatever.

04:00.390 --> 04:01.890
That's not good!

04:03.430 --> 04:06.780
Yuiko wants to be
friends with you, Ritsuka!

04:06.780 --> 04:08.560
Can't you forgive me?

04:08.560 --> 04:09.810
Miss Hawatari.

04:10.940 --> 04:12.480
We're in the middle of class.

04:13.980 --> 04:16.070
Well, let's continue...

04:17.390 --> 04:19.360
That was my fault.

04:20.200 --> 04:21.990
You'll forgive me?

04:21.990 --> 04:22.700
Yeah.

04:22.700 --> 04:23.950
Thank you!

04:24.580 --> 04:27.850
Say, what are you reading?

04:29.040 --> 04:30.790
Oh, but this is different.

04:31.070 --> 04:35.730
Nobody told me to ask
you, and I'm not being used...

04:35.730 --> 04:38.040
Yuiko wanted to ask you.

04:39.440 --> 04:41.550
This is how it should be, right Ritsuka?

04:42.550 --> 04:45.190
Yeah, that's good...

04:45.190 --> 04:48.010
I hate those who just
do what people say.

04:52.810 --> 04:54.960
So, what's the book?

04:54.960 --> 04:56.030
Nietzsche

04:57.530 --> 04:59.040
That's such a cool name!

04:59.040 --> 05:00.200
You...

05:00.200 --> 05:01.680
Miss Hawatari!

05:02.030 --> 05:02.940
Oh, yes?

05:02.940 --> 05:06.020
We're in the middle of
class. Please be quiet.

05:06.020 --> 05:07.350
Yes, ma'am...

05:12.450 --> 05:14.190
Ritsuka!

05:16.710 --> 05:19.880
Wait, let's go home together.

05:23.470 --> 05:27.670
If you keep on tagging along with
me, nothing good will come out of it.

05:27.670 --> 05:30.130
Not "you." My name is Yuiko!

05:30.130 --> 05:31.690
Call me Yuiko!

05:31.690 --> 05:32.520
No.

05:32.520 --> 05:35.210
Hey, why? Why?

05:35.210 --> 05:37.230
No means no.

05:37.230 --> 05:38.940
Come on!

05:38.940 --> 05:40.020
Ritsuka.

05:42.070 --> 05:42.940
Soubi.

05:44.280 --> 05:46.820
Ritsuka, I missed you.

05:51.460 --> 05:52.240
Here.

05:54.000 --> 05:55.840
What, a love letter?

05:55.840 --> 05:57.110
No!

06:04.180 --> 06:05.340
Thank you...

06:06.140 --> 06:07.290
I'll treasure it.

06:07.640 --> 06:08.840
Hey, hey Ritsuka.

06:09.220 --> 06:10.730
Who is he?

06:10.730 --> 06:12.620
Say, introduce him to me.

06:12.620 --> 06:14.140
It's none of your business.

06:14.400 --> 06:17.390
Awww! Why? Why?

06:17.390 --> 06:20.530
Please, don't blow me off.

06:20.530 --> 06:23.710
Hey, Ritsuka!

06:23.710 --> 06:24.700
Soubi!

06:26.160 --> 06:27.350
You have time?

06:27.780 --> 06:29.050
As much as you like.

06:29.050 --> 06:30.540
Then come with me.

06:30.540 --> 06:32.370
Explain the other day.

06:32.730 --> 06:33.870
Yuiko will go too!

06:34.150 --> 06:35.960
This is important.

06:35.960 --> 06:37.540
Don't follow us!

06:37.540 --> 06:40.330
It's not "you." It's Yuiko!

06:42.550 --> 06:44.420
We're going, Soubi.

06:45.130 --> 06:45.980
Okay.

06:49.010 --> 06:51.060
Ritsuka...

06:57.190 --> 06:58.510
Are you cold?

07:00.680 --> 07:02.260
Explain it to me!

07:02.260 --> 07:03.300
What was it?

07:03.300 --> 07:04.520
Don't act dumb.

07:06.530 --> 07:07.710
You want to kill them, right?

07:08.700 --> 07:10.610
The people who killed Seimei.

07:11.540 --> 07:13.450
You know who it is?

07:15.410 --> 07:18.830
I'll kill them for you, if you wish.

07:22.210 --> 07:24.500
I love you, Ritsuka.

07:34.680 --> 07:37.600
Seimei, what's wrong with him?

07:37.750 --> 07:41.570
How can he whisper words of murder
and love in the same breath?

07:49.910 --> 07:51.990
Did you look for Seimei's will?

08:09.010 --> 08:10.340
Soubi.

08:11.390 --> 08:12.790
I had to come...

08:15.220 --> 08:17.260
Ritsuka! Ritsuka!

08:17.270 --> 08:18.640
Is there someone with you?

08:19.190 --> 08:21.100
Please, Ritsuka, come out.

08:21.100 --> 08:24.190
I made a lot of your
favorite chestnut rice...

08:24.190 --> 08:25.900
Hey, Ritsuka!

08:25.900 --> 08:27.150
Ritsuka, please, come out!

08:27.150 --> 08:29.520
She's annoying. Should I quiet her?

08:30.620 --> 08:32.610
Forget about her.

08:33.160 --> 08:35.320
She's the mother of Seimei and me.

08:39.790 --> 08:40.790
Password?

08:41.790 --> 08:47.630
B... E... L... O... V... E... D...

08:48.050 --> 08:49.000
Beloved...

08:49.750 --> 08:51.050
The file is password protected. In addition, an Image Read

08:49.750 --> 08:51.050
5.0 error occurred and the file was unable to open.

08:52.890 --> 08:53.590
What was it?

08:54.720 --> 08:57.520
What was my real name?

08:57.890 --> 08:59.000
Loveless.

08:59.390 --> 09:00.790
One without love.

09:01.150 --> 09:10.150
The spelling is
L... O... V... E... L... E... S... S...

09:11.320 --> 09:12.970
What an awful name...

09:12.970 --> 09:14.920
Who decides these names anyway?

09:16.040 --> 09:17.730
I'd like to know as well...

09:18.450 --> 09:21.850
But it's already decided
before you were born...

09:22.210 --> 09:26.620
No choice, just like fate.

09:30.750 --> 09:31.840
It opened.

09:32.630 --> 09:32.670
To Ritsuka...

09:32.760 --> 09:32.800
I knew you
would read this someday.

09:33.710 --> 09:33.760
If I have died, that's
because I was murdered.

09:35.930 --> 09:35.970
I am going to be
killed by the Septimal Moon.

09:38.520 --> 09:39.640
Killed?

09:39.640 --> 09:40.050
To Ritsuka...

09:39.640 --> 09:40.050
I knew you
would read this someday.

09:39.640 --> 09:40.050
If I have died, that's
because I was murdered.

09:39.640 --> 09:40.050
I am going to be
killed by the Septimal Moon.

09:43.900 --> 09:45.600
Septimal Moon?

09:45.600 --> 09:45.640
If I have died, that's
because I was murdered.

09:45.600 --> 09:45.640
Ritsuka...

09:45.600 --> 09:45.640
I'm going to
leave you a Sentouki.

09:49.530 --> 09:50.520
Sentouki!

09:51.320 --> 09:52.360
What the hell is this?

09:52.860 --> 09:55.950
You are here because
you were told by Seimei?

09:56.530 --> 09:57.360
Yes.

09:58.200 --> 10:01.810
Then, when you said
you loved me, it was because...

10:02.210 --> 10:05.920
...you were told by Seimei to love me?

10:05.920 --> 10:06.790
That's right.

10:07.460 --> 10:11.210
So you listen to anything Seimei says.

10:12.050 --> 10:14.390
Seimei's words are absolute...

10:15.260 --> 10:19.590
Now, I listen to your commands,
because that's what I've been told.

10:19.590 --> 10:20.840
Cut the crap!

10:23.190 --> 10:24.490
I love you, Ritsuka.

10:30.480 --> 10:31.900
Not right...

10:31.900 --> 10:33.770
It's not right!

10:34.740 --> 10:38.560
Love happens naturally in your heart...

10:39.580 --> 10:43.530
But loving someone because
you're following orders, that's...

10:48.420 --> 10:50.460
I love you, Ritsuka.

10:53.090 --> 10:54.280
Shut up!

11:00.180 --> 11:01.590
I don't want to hear it.

11:08.110 --> 11:09.530
I have no one...

11:09.530 --> 11:12.050
Seimei, Soubi and Mother...

11:12.050 --> 11:16.590
I have nothing of my
own, not even myself...

11:24.460 --> 11:25.920
Whoa, what's this?

11:25.920 --> 11:27.260
What? What?

11:27.260 --> 11:29.020
Here, look...

11:29.020 --> 11:32.210
The victim was Seimei Aoyagi, age 17.

11:32.790 --> 11:34.840
Is this Ritsuka's brother?

11:34.840 --> 11:36.130
No way!

11:36.130 --> 11:38.880
He was burned to death!

11:39.010 --> 11:41.260
Scary!

11:41.260 --> 11:43.330
Let's not look at such a thing...

11:44.310 --> 11:46.310
It's not nice to Ritsuka.

11:46.310 --> 11:47.980
What, is it wrong?

11:47.980 --> 11:50.150
Yeah, it's interesting.

11:50.150 --> 11:53.690
A high school student was found dead
in an elementary school classroom...

11:53.690 --> 11:55.770
I'm interested, too...

11:56.490 --> 11:58.780
...in who killed my brother.

11:59.660 --> 12:03.450
My brother's corpse
was sitting in my seat...

12:03.820 --> 12:08.620
...all charred, and the whole room reeked.

12:12.500 --> 12:14.050
Ritsuka!

12:21.180 --> 12:23.430
Wait, Ritsuka!

12:23.430 --> 12:24.930
Please wait!

12:28.230 --> 12:31.270
Um, sorry about everybody...

12:31.270 --> 12:32.920
I'm really sorry...

12:32.920 --> 12:35.060
It's none of your business.

12:35.060 --> 12:35.980
Let go!

12:35.980 --> 12:36.780
No!

12:36.780 --> 12:37.860
No, no!

12:37.860 --> 12:40.480
Yuiko wants to get along with Ritsuka...

12:40.680 --> 12:43.110
Because, Yuiko loves you...

12:43.110 --> 12:43.700
Don't say that!

12:46.870 --> 12:49.320
Don't say that
you love me so easily.

12:52.790 --> 12:56.080
I don't want anyone to tell
me that they love me.

12:56.080 --> 12:57.770
But...

12:57.770 --> 13:01.760
Making a girl cry isn't admirable.

13:02.720 --> 13:06.350
Surprisingly enough, you're a pretty bad guy,
Loveless.

13:06.350 --> 13:07.850
We have come to get you again...

13:08.600 --> 13:10.560
...as a messenger from the Septimal Moon.

13:12.020 --> 13:14.390
Well then, I also have
something to ask you.

13:17.740 --> 13:19.870
You, go back to class.

13:21.030 --> 13:23.430
I'll be friends with you later.

13:24.370 --> 13:25.360
I promise...

13:26.040 --> 13:28.270
...so don't tell this to anybody.

13:28.270 --> 13:29.120
But...

13:29.120 --> 13:32.270
Just listen to me, got it?

13:35.040 --> 13:36.460
It's a promise.

13:39.420 --> 13:41.920
Chemistry Lab

13:43.010 --> 13:43.880
So...

13:45.640 --> 13:47.890
...what do you want to ask?

13:48.520 --> 13:49.640
Why did you kill him?

13:51.890 --> 13:54.020
Why did you kill Seimei?

13:54.020 --> 13:55.390
No comment.

13:55.980 --> 13:58.100
So you're not going to deny
the fact that you killed him.

13:59.070 --> 14:01.560
It's not that Ai and I did it.

14:02.530 --> 14:04.400
What is the "Septimal Moon"?

14:04.750 --> 14:06.620
What are planning to do with me?

14:06.990 --> 14:08.710
Why don't you ask Soubi?

14:08.710 --> 14:10.450
Is he not going to tell you?

14:10.960 --> 14:12.510
He is your Sentouki, isn't he?

14:14.220 --> 14:17.590
It... it has nothing to do with him!

14:18.040 --> 14:20.520
Sorry to make you wait, Ritsuka.

14:22.630 --> 14:23.670
Soubi!

14:24.220 --> 14:27.630
They are part of the
group that killed Seimei.

14:28.260 --> 14:29.520
What should we do?

14:30.050 --> 14:30.720
Fight?

14:31.980 --> 14:34.390
Don't worry. Believe in me...

14:34.980 --> 14:37.780
I am the only one who
can fight for Ritsuka.

14:39.570 --> 14:41.930
You better explain to me later.

14:42.530 --> 14:43.320
Fine.

14:43.590 --> 14:46.530
What are you going to do, fight or not?

14:47.780 --> 14:50.380
I declare this to be a battle of spells.

14:52.180 --> 14:53.160
We accept!

14:53.370 --> 14:55.390
Sentou system, on!

15:00.460 --> 15:03.860
We're Breathless, so fierce
it's impossible to breathe.

15:08.010 --> 15:09.750
What can I do?

15:10.180 --> 15:11.340
Just stay behind me.

15:13.520 --> 15:15.440
You are a Sacrifice.

15:15.980 --> 15:17.180
Sacrifice?

15:18.690 --> 15:21.440
You are to offer yourself.

15:23.150 --> 15:24.500
You ready?

15:24.860 --> 15:26.860
This time it's gonna be different.

15:27.030 --> 15:28.820
(Rip apart, attack)

15:27.030 --> 15:28.820
Renzoku Retsu-Pa!

15:29.040 --> 15:30.240
(Defense)

15:29.070 --> 15:30.240
Bou Gyo!

15:34.120 --> 15:35.390
(Inversion)

15:34.120 --> 15:35.390
Han Ten!

15:36.250 --> 15:37.120
(Reflection)

15:36.250 --> 15:37.120
Han Sha!

15:37.120 --> 15:38.680
B-Bou Gyo!

15:40.840 --> 15:42.000
(Defense, defense)

15:40.840 --> 15:42.000
Bou Gyo! Bou Gyo!

15:44.090 --> 15:44.670
Midori!

15:47.220 --> 15:49.420
W-What is that?

15:49.420 --> 15:53.050
Restriction. It is to limit movement.

15:53.600 --> 15:58.220
The Sentouki fights, and the
Sacrifice takes the damage.

15:59.900 --> 16:01.730
Sacrifice and restriction?

16:01.880 --> 16:03.010
Midori!

16:03.440 --> 16:04.730
Be careful...

16:05.070 --> 16:08.740
His spells are precise.
If we go on like this...

16:08.740 --> 16:12.150
Yes, it'll be too late for your defense.

16:12.740 --> 16:13.660
You mock me!

16:13.660 --> 16:14.710
Calm down, Ai!

16:15.540 --> 16:17.390
They have different names.

16:17.870 --> 16:20.290
If we can restrain that Sacrifice...

16:20.290 --> 16:22.960
...their damage doubles.

16:22.960 --> 16:23.620
Got it.

16:24.710 --> 16:27.540
Those powers will not reach here.

16:30.840 --> 16:31.970
(Severance)

16:30.840 --> 16:31.970
Setsu Dan!

16:32.300 --> 16:33.660
(Rotation)

16:32.300 --> 16:33.690
Kai Ten!

16:33.690 --> 16:35.090
(Diffraction)

16:33.720 --> 16:35.090
Kai Setsu!

16:35.800 --> 16:36.830
(Severance)

16:35.800 --> 16:36.830
Setsu Dan!

16:41.610 --> 16:43.020
I couldn't protect him well enough...

16:43.020 --> 16:44.730
You have time to look aside?

16:44.730 --> 16:46.460
Setsu Dan!

16:46.820 --> 16:48.750
Again, Kai Ten! Kai Setsu!

16:47.670 --> 16:48.750
(Rotation and Diffraction)

16:48.750 --> 16:49.860
Impossible!

16:49.860 --> 16:52.030
You guys who have no
love can't dodge this!

16:55.910 --> 16:56.530
Ritsuka!

16:57.620 --> 16:59.990
Seimei did these, too?

17:03.420 --> 17:07.200
Yes, it's really painful, but...

17:08.170 --> 17:10.050
...Ritsuka, can you endure it?

17:12.050 --> 17:13.260
I'm fine!

17:14.470 --> 17:16.550
You have guts.

17:21.060 --> 17:23.900
I love you, Ritsuka.

17:26.690 --> 17:28.110
N-No!

17:40.160 --> 17:41.330
Confused?

17:41.330 --> 17:45.830
There's no way two brats with ears
know the real meaning of love!

17:49.970 --> 17:53.300
I know something you don't!

17:55.130 --> 17:56.490
(Defense)

17:55.130 --> 17:56.490
B-Bou Gyo!

18:00.730 --> 18:02.060
(Negate)

18:00.730 --> 18:02.060
Mu Kou!

18:02.060 --> 18:03.580
All walls will crumble.

18:10.780 --> 18:11.940
Defeat!

18:37.510 --> 18:38.550
Ritsuka.

18:42.480 --> 18:43.430
Are you okay?

18:47.690 --> 18:50.430
Did you... kill them?

18:51.150 --> 18:52.320
Not yet.

18:52.320 --> 18:53.690
They've only fainted.

18:54.450 --> 18:57.440
But it's all right.
I'll do whatever you like.

18:59.450 --> 19:02.700
I don't kill...

19:03.660 --> 19:05.190
Don't kill them!

19:05.190 --> 19:07.590
Then, I'll go and return them...

19:10.500 --> 19:12.170
I love you, Ritsuka...

19:14.800 --> 19:16.170
I don't want to hear it!

19:19.810 --> 19:25.010
I don't want to hear it anymore!

19:26.060 --> 19:27.490
Get out!

19:34.900 --> 19:39.950
Why are you turning me into such a wreck?

19:42.540 --> 19:43.910
Saying that you love me...

19:46.540 --> 19:48.040
Soubi...

19:54.460 --> 19:55.340
Ritsuka

20:03.810 --> 20:07.190
You want to be friends with me?

20:08.310 --> 20:09.870
I'll keep my promise...

20:10.270 --> 20:10.980
Really?!

20:11.180 --> 20:14.670
Then! Then! Yuiko will
be good friends with you!

20:14.670 --> 20:19.250
Th-then, stop addressing
yourself with your name.

20:19.740 --> 20:21.700
Say "I."

20:22.080 --> 20:23.240
I?

20:23.240 --> 20:23.910
Yeah

20:25.370 --> 20:26.700
I!

20:26.850 --> 20:30.010
I, I, I!

20:30.750 --> 20:33.130
Aha! Ritsuka, you smiled!

20:33.130 --> 20:36.470
Yuiko, no, I like you this way!

20:36.470 --> 20:39.300
I really love it when you smile!

20:40.220 --> 20:41.320
Love...

20:46.890 --> 20:48.770
Hey doctor.

20:49.570 --> 20:52.180
Everybody says the word "love" so easily...

20:52.520 --> 20:56.090
...but what does it mean
when you love somebody?

20:56.090 --> 20:57.020
Well...

20:57.820 --> 21:02.940
To love somebody, it's difficult if you
don't love yourself as you are now.

21:05.040 --> 21:06.770
Who I am now?

21:07.330 --> 21:09.920
Ritsuka, do you like somebody?

21:11.880 --> 21:13.290
I...

21:14.800 --> 21:16.500
I like you.

21:18.340 --> 21:19.710
I like the current Ritsuka.

21:21.890 --> 21:24.500
Doctor, take some pictures with me!

21:24.500 --> 21:26.750
All right! Let's do it!

21:27.800 --> 21:32.770
To be continued...

21:29.810 --> 21:39.360
Setsunasa no kagiri made dakishimete mo

21:29.810 --> 21:39.360
Even if I hold you with all my suffering,

21:40.150 --> 21:49.660
itsu made mo hitotsu ni wa narenakute

21:40.150 --> 21:49.660
we still can't be one.

21:50.240 --> 22:00.170
Yasashisa yori fukai basho de fureau no wa itami dake

21:50.240 --> 22:00.170
The only thing that we can feel deep within besides kindness is pain,

22:00.590 --> 22:08.180
futari wo musunde kudasai

22:00.590 --> 22:08.180
so please, bind the two of us together.

22:10.720 --> 22:15.560
Bokura wa mou yume wo minai

22:10.720 --> 22:15.560
We no longer dream anymore,

22:15.560 --> 22:20.690
tomadoinagara te wo totte

22:15.560 --> 22:20.690
when you're wavering, take my hand

22:20.980 --> 22:29.910
zankoku na yoake no hou e arukidasu

22:20.980 --> 22:29.910
as we tread towards the cruel light of dawn.

22:31.030 --> 22:41.040
Hontou no kotoba wa kitto hontou no sekai no dokoka

22:31.030 --> 22:41.040
I'm sure real words are somewhere in the real world.

22:41.380 --> 22:50.260
Bokura no mukuchi na yoru ni hisonderu

22:41.380 --> 22:50.260
They lurk in the shadows of our silent nights.

22:50.640 --> 22:55.770
Ima mo kitto

22:50.640 --> 22:55.770
Surely, even now...

23:01.280 --> 23:04.270
I found out Soubi's
secret for the first time...

23:05.360 --> 23:09.590
From the moment I met him, I
didn't think he was the same as me...

23:10.160 --> 23:14.290
I'm astonished by
your strength, Ritsuka.

23:15.120 --> 23:19.430
I love you, but sorry...

23:19.430 --> 23:22.590
Tale three, Bondless.

23:22.590 --> 23:24.120
Let's begin training.
